            <ArticleTitle>[Study of molecular damage in bronchial asthma and cerebrovascular disorders during the course of rehabilitation ].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>17-8</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Drug treatment of cerebrovascular disorders alone and in combination with UV irradiation of autoblood gave rise to a positive trend in clinical and functional parameters more noticeable in the combined treatment. Also, there was a fall in red cell levels of malonic dialdehyde. A course of speleotherapy given to children with bronchial asthma contributed to normalization of free radical oxidation and reestablishment of molecular structure in red cell membranes.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
